<title>CHILE: Chile's Concha y Toro nine-month net up.</title>
<headline>Chile's Concha y Toro nine-month net up.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winery Vina Concha y Toro SA reported the following results in the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>			     9-mo 1996	 9-mo 1995</p>
<p>Net profit			4.68    profit  2.46</p>
<p>Operating profit		4.94    profit  2.95</p>
<p>Non-operating profit	  0.32    loss    0.24</p>
<p>Total sales		    29.16	     24.36</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures are in billions of Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595 x212</p>
</text>
